Task: PostgreSQL Schema Script & Database Connectivity
Summary: Implemented reflection-free PostgreSQL database initialization script (schema.sql), HikariCP configuration, and DatabaseInit executor with unit tests.
Files:
- schema.sql: Canonical DDL script creating users, daily_targets, meals, meal_items, daily_weights tables and indexes
- backend/src/main/resources/schema.sql: Packaged schema script for backend runtime initialization
- backend/src/main/scala/com/calcul/db/DatabaseConfig.scala: Direct HikariCP data source configuration
- backend/src/main/scala/com/calcul/db/DatabaseInit.scala: Zero-reflection DDL script runner and table validator
- backend/src/test/scala/com/calcul/db/DatabaseSetupSuite.scala: MUnit test verifying DDL execution and connection pooling
Why: Provides the persistent relational storage layer without heavy reflection or migration frameworks, strictly optimized for GraalVM Native Image.
